  "selectionGuide": {
    "brief": "정찰 · 방어 — 편성 1+9 = 10명",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "ARCHETYPES: RECON, SECURITY"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "OPERATIVES"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "↘ 1 NOVITIATE SUPERIOR operative with one of the following options:\n• Plasma pistol; power weapon\n• Relic boltgun; gun butt\n• Relic bolt pistol; power weapon"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "↘ 9 NOVITIATE operatives selected from the following list:\n• CONDEMNOR\n• DIALOGUS\n• DUELLIST\n• EXACTOR\n• HOSPITALLER\n• PENITENT\n• PRECEPTOR\n• PRONATUS\n• PURGATUS\n• RELIQUARIUS\n• MILITANT with one of the following options:\n○ Autopistol; Novitiate blade\n○ Autogun; gun butt"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Other than MILITANT and PURGATUS operatives, your kill team can only include each operative on this list once. Your kill team can only include up to two PURGATUS operatives."
      }
    ]
  },
  "factionRule": {
    "brief": "ACTS OF FAITH",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "ACTS OF FAITH"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Such is the zeal of the Adepta Sororitas that in their presence the Emperor's divine will is made manifest. In the Ready step of each Strategy phase, you gain a number of Faith points equal to half the number of friendly NOVITIATE operatives that haven't been incapacitated (rounding up). Whenever a friendly NOVITIATE operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, or an operative is shooting it, in the Roll Attack Dice (or Roll Defence Dice step if an operative is shooting it), you can spend your Faith points to use one ACT OF FAITH. You cannot use more than one ACT OF FAITH per sequence, and their costs and effects are as follows (see other side of card):"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "GUIDANCE 1 FAITH POINT"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "You can re-roll one of your dice."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "BLESSING 2 FAITH POINTS"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "You can retain one of your normal successes as a critical success instead."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "INTERVENTION 3 FAITH POINTS"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "You can retain one of your fails as a normal success instead of discarding it."
      }
    ]
  },
  "source": "킬 팀 공식 영문 룰 PDF ('26년 8월 에라타 반영)"
}
